Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Explorer right-click menu: show the full classic menu right away
; instead of the short Windows 11 menu with "Show more options".
; An empty InprocServer32 default value disables the new menu's COM handler.
; Undo: delete the key below, i.e. import
;   [-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}]

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}\InprocServer32]
@=""
